# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [0.0.1-alpha.0] - 2026-03-10

### Added
- JSX-like PCP syntax
- AST-based compiler
- Component autoload + compile-on-demand
- Runtime node system
- Islands support
- HMR development support
- New slot syntax:
  - `<Card\Header>...</Card\Header>`
  - `<Slot:Header />` / `<Slot:Header></Slot:Header>`

### Changed
- Slots now compile to named `Node` constructor arguments

### Removed
- Legacy `slot="..."`